{"candidate_identity":"0cb6bfd8bdf0e0a2af57bc4a5289b32fe88634dfdae7a02107215239253f747a","payload":{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e51fac4c859fe9efae0f15680a00e4f0354fba4b86423b4299eaa20a6e61f8eb","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"26251dd6b1dfcc86f12e7f92123d2e903f835a4c51cfb64df808c6bf688b23cb","logical_entry_identity":"8a997d93020874cbd032273a4dd410328f734d7b470cfa029147fa7f81539f81","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Larger than a normal wolf, it prowls and snaps at you.","source_tag":"_t","target":"它比普通的狼更大，潜行游荡时会朝你猛咬。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5590a1800a8acd923ec59a094b7185be480440588fbe0f722c9e1fd46525fa0a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"91c9981a323204a27c554192e97dd0995537c90662e35d2f97051b0f10cafeb5","logical_entry_identity":"1d1de9379cb014e6b149413439712e5375a34a8726a07fb6f700b3ebb96e2017","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*He quickly looks at the tome and looks amazed.*#WHITE# This is an amazing find! Truly amazing!\nWith this knowledge I could create potent amulets. However, it requires a special place of power to craft such items.\nThere are rumours about a site of power in the southern mountains. Old legends tell about a place where a part of the Wintertide Moon melted when it got too close to the Sun and fell from the sky.\nA lake formed in the crater of the crash. The water of this lake, soaked in intense Moonlight for eons, should be sufficient to forge powerful artifacts!\nGo to the lake and then summon me with this scroll. I will retire to study the tome, awaiting your summon.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*他快速浏览了那本手册，露出了惊讶的表情。*#WHITE# 这真是神奇的发现！太神奇了！\n有了这些知识，我就能制造强力的项链了。不过，制作这样的物品需要一个特殊的力量之地。\n传言南部山脉中有一处力量之地。古老传说称，霜华之月的一部分因离太阳过近而融化，并从天空坠落。\n坠落形成的陨坑中出现了一座湖泊。这座湖的湖水经万古强烈月光浸润，应该足以锻造强大的神器！\n前往那座湖，然后用这张卷轴召唤我。我会回去研究这本手册，等待你的召唤。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"942e2376172b8bcb2a3ad191ac7357d8f0d6e380bd05ddb0421ebb2e90feb898","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9a2fb5d4ba965add5ef02b52f3b4e93247994a43042a158111308210324d6c99","logical_entry_identity":"9ba846a4c1f48ac1576f54699576a54aedf2b16f2c429cf231bfbe66af421008","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Fire and guide an arrow to its target with precise telekinetic nudges. Does normal damage, but accuracy and crit chance are increased by %d.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"射出一支箭，以念力精确地微调箭矢，导引它射向目标。造成普通伤害，但命中和暴击率提高 %d。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"eb16b16e6fae826ede0ae94bda357f1cb3089e03ddd4e7eace679f7c5281ac0f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f009c2b19b56fc07e3295fc2f78de030f225f8a71155cc759513910e448bd44f","logical_entry_identity":"38e2b667dac8c23ac4445f0fff0e5615ab86a756aa00884b06e9aa08084551d0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"grandfathered","source_tag":"_t","target":"因弹指间度过了无数美好的青葱岁月，转瞬间你已白发苍苍"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e7544090cfe1f1452b033b118e664fa3342b27b1b1b18bd42aabe750c7956d3c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f00d14e74c6bd0e5409f3a7898ba5c5e80bde8d34cb27030d59ccb7f754f3988","logical_entry_identity":"fbda701abc3252883aefa04fd10c86e32705fbf4b51c2eb97197f801595c4d9f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This towering naga exudes power, and radiates a certain charismatic charm as well. His masculine face stares at you with great intensity, and you struggle to meet his gaze. His torso is bare apart from an exquisite pearl set directly in his chest, and in his muscular arms he holds ready a heavy mace and shield. You sense there is more to him also, as if the very power of the ocean were concentrated in this great creature, and that the wrath of it may come flooding out at any moment.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这只铁塔般的娜迦散发着强大的能量，同时也流露着某种迷人的魅力。他刚毅的面容热切地盯着你，你几乎无法直视他的目光。他赤裸的上身只在胸口正中嵌着一颗精致的珍珠，强壮的臂膀中分别握着一把沉重的钉头锤和一面盾牌。你感觉到他身上还隐藏着更深的东西，仿佛整个海洋的力量都凝聚在这位伟大的生物身上，其怒火随时可能喷涌而出。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0b635c31cdea33690ee3e98af095af6413f1f3075780ced417488ad75ef5204e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f00e4262dd3f612682269914f5e7ef251726c45dd8e9189359878d47bd981f43","logical_entry_identity":"0769b091e3fa6f76a82a18a27ee4f368e087834f95825e1cd966ddd5cabfab4b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You have survived the onslaught of undead. You notice a way to climb up you had not seen before in a wall nearby.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你从不死生物的猛攻中存活了下来，你看到旁边的墙上有一条之前没有发现的通路，可以爬上去。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"99096fabb8e05ed155bdddabdf1d4f212afcc26f1f51e1da647ff835b6ce64a9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f01075f8b5a6f706ea5e9d4e8261c71697aab7f7addd3c0414bd7979b6c0e4aa","logical_entry_identity":"4eef164a01c972a546eabc1586c6e9661d282926836c0d64187976f3d31f815b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"gloom","source_tag":"effect subtype","target":"黑暗光环"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3d7b434e9dd884c4d07afe604b73a7061edbc552658bdab26ccfafc860571ead","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f014d4aa636c9b58fde94067f285fcc7d666546173c7944b7642595dca164037","logical_entry_identity":"e88c514c10b70208c5368c562edab0c67dfbabbc8ef99c09504343659c313a28","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Companion Warrior","source_tag":"entity name","target":"同伴战士"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e4ad3b8d907a06b3afb39cd0a47ff3ddb3b8dd765dc91b6b80c1ab8a0d4986d7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f0211fd483ff61ada86a92b943bdcb99124e65dcc50d433a51b612363a4fe34e","logical_entry_identity":"95d9ce45b4401d872abb5c29fdb6e7c823a81e19b6a09fd162e35a486f16af6f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Call upon the legendary resilience of the Dwarven race to increase armour (+%d), armour hardiness (+%d%%), spell (+%d) and physical (+%d) saves for 8 turns.\n\t\tThe bonuses will increase with your Constitution.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"唤起矮人一族传说中的坚韧，使护甲值提高 +%d、护甲强度提高 +%d%%、法术豁免提高 +%d、物理豁免提高 +%d，持续 8 回合。\n\t\t这些加成随体质提高。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ef28fcac96fec